# MERGED 2026-09-28 when v2 moved to the repository root (wordle-teams-4m96.2).
# Neither the old root file nor v2's could be taken wholesale: the root's was
# mostly about a Next.js app that no longer exists, v2's assumed a parent
# .gitignore above it, and the two disagreed about .env handling. What follows is
# v2's list plus the root's SHARED entries, with v1's dropped.

# --- the app -----------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
.output
.nitro
.vinxi
.tanstack
.wrangler
__unconfig*
todos.json

# Playwright artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/

# --- environment files -------------------------------------------------------
# ORDER IS LOAD BEARING. `.env*` ignores everything, and the negation below
# un-ignores the one file that is COMMITTED ON PURPOSE — .env.production holds
# only public values (the Convex URLs every browser addresses, and a Sentry DSN
# that is in every client bundle by design). A negation before its pattern does
# nothing, so do not sort these.
#
# `.env.production.local` STAYS IGNORED, and that is not an accident of ordering:
# the negation has no wildcard, so it matches that one name and nothing else.
# That file holds the Supabase production credentials the copy script reads.
.env*
!.env.production

# Everything ending .local: .env.local, .beta-session.local, screenshots.local.
*.local

.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
!.env.example

# --- one-off production scripts ----------------------------------------------
# WAS TWO LINES, AND IS NOW CORRECTLY ONE. Before the move this read
# `scripts/*-prod.mjs` AND `v2/scripts/*-prod.mjs`, because a gitignore pattern
# containing a slash is anchored to the directory holding the file, so the first
# line said nothing at all about v2/scripts/. There is one scripts/ now.
#
# These hardcode real user email addresses and THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
scripts/*-prod.mjs

# --- tooling and session artifacts -------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.sentryclirc
.env.sentry-build-plugin
.specstory/*
.cursor/*
.superpowers/

# Vercel's local link. v1's deployment still serves production until the DNS
# flip, but nothing in this repository builds it any more.
.vercel

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key

# built launch-email artefacts (scripts/build-launch-email.mjs)
build/

# the launch email footer address, supplied at build time (PUBLIC repo)
.launch-postal-address

# git worktrees for isolated investigation/feature branches
.worktrees/
